## Authentication

This API uses JWT (JSON Web Token) based authentication.

### How it works

1. Login via `POST /api/auth/login`
2. Receive a token in the response
3. Include the token in every subsequent request header:
```
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
```

Tokens expire after 24 hours. Login again to get a new token.

