| View records            | ✅     | ✅      | ✅    |
| View dashboard          | ✅     | ✅      | ✅    |
| Create record           | ❌     | ✅      | ✅    |
| Edit record             | ❌     | ✅      | ✅    |
| Delete record           | ❌     | ❌      | ✅    |
| View all users          | ❌     | ❌      | ✅    |
| Change user role        | ❌     | ❌      | ✅    |
| Activate/deactivate user| ❌     | ❌      | ✅    |

New users who register are assigned the **Viewer** role by default.
Only an Admin can promote users to Analyst or Admin.

