### Users (Admin only)

#### Get all users
```
GET /api/users
Authorization: Bearer <token>

Response 200:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "users": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Super Admin",
        "email": "admin@company.com",
        "role": "admin",
        "is_active": 1,
        "created_at": "2026-04-05 10:00:00"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

#### Get single user
```
GET /api/users/:id
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

#### Change user role
```
PATCH /api/users/:id/role
Authorization: Bearer <token>

Body:
{
  "role": "analyst"
}

Response 200:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "message": "User role updated to analyst",
    "userId": 2,
    "newRole": "analyst"
  }
}
```

#### Activate or deactivate user
```
PATCH /api/users/:id/status
Authorization: Bearer <token>

Body:
{
  "is_active": false
}

Response 200:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "message": "User account deactivated successfully",
    "userId": 2,
    "is_active": false
  }
}
```

