### Financial Records

#### Get all records
```
GET /api/records
Authorization: Bearer <token>

Optional query filters:
  ?type=income
  ?type=expense
  ?category=Salary
  ?start_date=2026-01-01
  ?end_date=2026-04-30

These filters can be combined:
  ?type=expense&category=Food&start_date=2026-01-01

Response 200:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "count": 6,
    "records": [...]
  }
}
```

#### Get single record
```
GET /api/records/:id
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

#### Create record (Analyst and Admin)
```
POST /api/records
Authorization: Bearer <token>

Body:
{
  "amount": 50000,
  "type": "income",
  "category": "Salary",
  "date": "2026-04-01",
  "notes": "April salary"
}

Rules:
- amount must be a positive number
- type must be income or expense
- date must be in YYYY-MM-DD format
- notes is optional

Response 201:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "message": "Record created successfully",
    "record": { ... }
  }
}
```

#### Update record (Analyst and Admin)
```
PATCH /api/records/:id
Authorization: Bearer <token>

Body (all fields optional, send only what you want to change):
{
  "amount": 55000,
  "notes": "Revised salary"
}
```

#### Delete record (Admin only)
```
DELETE /api/records/:id
Authorization: Bearer <token>

Response 200:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "message": "Record deleted successfully",
    "recordId": 1
  }
}
```

