## Data Models

### Users table

| Column     | Type    | Description                        |
|------------|---------|------------------------------------|
| id         | INTEGER | Primary key, auto increment        |
| name       | TEXT    | Full name                          |
| email      | TEXT    | Unique email address               |
| password   | TEXT    | Bcrypt hashed password             |
| role       | TEXT    | viewer, analyst, or admin          |
| is_active  | INTEGER | 1 = active, 0 = deactivated        |
| created_at | TEXT    | Timestamp of account creation      |

### Financial Records table

| Column     | Type    | Description                        |
|------------|---------|------------------------------------|
| id         | INTEGER | Primary key, auto increment        |
| amount     | REAL    | Positive decimal number            |
| type       | TEXT    | income or expense                  |
| category   | TEXT    | e.g. Salary, Rent, Food            |
| date       | TEXT    | Date in YYYY-MM-DD format          |
| notes      | TEXT    | Optional description               |
| created_by | INTEGER | Foreign key referencing users.id   |
| created_at | TEXT    | Timestamp of record creation       |

