## Design Decisions

### Why SQLite?
Simple file based setup with no external database server required.
Perfect for this scale of application and easy to run locally.

### Why better-sqlite3?
Synchronous API that fits naturally with Express without needing async/await
for every database call. Simpler and faster for this use case.

### Why JWT?
Stateless authentication. The server does not need to store sessions.
The token carries the user's identity and role, verified on every request.

### Why separate model layer?
All database queries live in model files. Controllers never write raw SQL.
This makes the code easier to maintain and test independently.

### Why COALESCE in summary queries?
If no records exist, SUM returns NULL. COALESCE converts NULL to 0
so the API always returns a number, never null.

